Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Check", "Chapter",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.996661018778241*^9, 
  3.996661019505378*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"fd53b160-2aa6-4a38-8d7f-\
21236b922f4e"],

Cell["\<\
We exhibit below the differences between Archive and Matchete results and \
between Archive and Matchmakereft results: 
\t(1) the difference in \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]\[EmptyUpTriangle]WC[\
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote](4)\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote],\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]H\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]]\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] comes from the non-zero \
mass m11 in the SM Higgs propagator and fades away in the limit m11 << m22;
\t(2) the other differences vanish when we impose the permutation symmetry \
among (ff1,ff2) and (ff3,ff4) and tree-level Fierz identities, which leads to \
the equivalent tree-level physical consequences but reveal different \
evanescent scenarios.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.00199328540119*^9, 4.001993311860364*^9}, {
  4.002079805566391*^9, 4.00207981316147*^9}, {4.0020799013196507`*^9, 
